  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When the berserker enters a rage, he may spend 2 rounds of rage and select one willing creature to form a hunting pack with. Whenever at least two members of the same pack threaten the same target, that target is considered flanked by all members of the pack. This rage power may be taken more than once; each time, the berserker may select another willing creature to join the pack, costing 2 rounds of rage per willing creature.</p>",
